  "description": "The user is projected onto the group of women being addressed by the text ('all the ladies', 'the rest of you bitches'). The text uses 'you' to directly address the viewer/user as part of the target audience. The projection is onto the TextualMaterial entity 'text_chunk_1', which contains the deictic pronouns 'you' and 'your' (implied by 'your attention' and 'your bitches'). The user is positioned as one of the 'ladies' being spoken to, either as the 'half naked' type or the 'bitches' type.",
